<section class="why" id="why-tidepool"><div class="container why-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Small gym. Whole lot of heart.</p><h2>You built a community.<br>We’ll handle the busywork.</h2><p>Your gym is more than a place to climb. It’s the first send, the familiar faces, the “one more try.” Tidepool makes room for more of that.</p><div class="why-list"><span><i class="tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</i> Simple enough for your whole team</span><span><i class="tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</i> A real human when you need a hand</span><span><i class="tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</i> A smooth move from your old system</span></div></div><div class="quote"><span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span><blockquote>More time learning names.<br>Less time chasing payments.<br>That’s the kind of progress<br>we’re here for.</blockquote><div class="quote-caption"><strong>The Tidepool philosophy</strong>Good software should give you time back.</div></div></div></section>
<div class="container"><section class="pricing" id="pricing"><div><p class="eyebrow">A good fit, from day one.</p><h2>Small-gym pricing.<br>Big-picture thinking.</h2><p>One simple plan for a smoother-running gym. All your core tools, your whole team, and a little breathing room.</p><p>No setup fees. No long-term contracts.<br>Just more time for the climb.</p></div><div class="price-card"><div class="price-top"><strong>The whole Tidepool</strong><span class="price-tag">ONE GYM. ALL IN.</span></div><div class="price">$99<span> / month</span></div><p>For independent gyms with up to 500 active members.</p><button class="button" data-action="demo">Let’s find your flow <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><div class="price-includes">✓ Memberships, class bookings, and day passes<br>✓ Unlimited team accounts and friendly support<br>✓ Guided setup and help moving your data</div><p style="font-size:10px;margin:13px 0 0">Payment processing fees apply separately.</p></div></section>
<section class="faq" id="questions"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before you chalk up.</p><h2>A few good questions.</h2></div><div><details><summary>Is Tidepool right for a small climbing gym?</summary><p>That’s exactly who it’s designed for. Tidepool brings the everyday essentials together for independent bouldering and climbing gyms, without making your team learn a complicated system.</p></details><details><summary>Can you help us move from our current software?</summary><p>Yes. We’ll walk through your current setup, help prepare your member data, and plan the switch with you so your team feels ready on day one.</p></details><details><summary>Can climbers book and buy passes on their phone?</summary><p>Yes. Your climbers can view your schedule, book classes, and purchase day passes from their phone’s browser. No app download needed.</p></details><details><summary>What if we have more than 500 members?</summary><p>We’d love to hear about your gym. Book a conversation and we’ll work through a plan that fits your community and your needs.</p></details></div></section>
